## Frontend environment variables (Vite)
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is the API ORIGIN only — every request path already starts with /api/...
#
# Local dev: leave it empty. Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:5153 (see vite.config.js).
#
# Production (e.g. Azure Static Web Apps):
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-app>.azurewebsites.net
# (A trailing "/api" is tolerated and stripped, so requests never become /api/api/...)
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
